&lt;b&gt;Pouvoirs magiques&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lancer-Des-Sorts#Nls.html&quot; title=&quot;NLS&quot;&gt;NLS&lt;/a&gt; 11 ; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lancer-Des-Sorts#Concentration.html&quot; title=&quot;Concentration&quot;&gt;concentration&lt;/a&gt; +13)
&lt;/div&gt;
