0 (&#224; volont&#233;) — &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lecture-De-La-Magie.html&quot; title=&quot;Lecture de la magie&quot;&gt;lecture de la magie&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Manipulation-&#192;-Distance.html&quot; title=&quot;Manipulation &#224; distance&quot;&gt;manipulation &#224; distance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Message.html&quot; title=&quot;Message&quot;&gt;message&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Prestidigitation.html&quot; title=&quot;Prestidigitation&quot;&gt;prestidigitation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
